{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52715","headline":"金虎白龙诗 二十一 · 张果","name":"金虎白龙诗 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此物天生人不知，阴阳真气兑爲离。\n坎宫五世求名姓，认得黄芽作圣基。\n（《正统道藏》本宋佚名《内丹秘诀》引）（按：《通志·艺文略》道类收张果〖通玄先生〗《玄珠歌逍遥歌内指黄芽歌》一卷。\n《玄珠歌》已见前录。\n本组诗多述黄芽，疑即《内指黄芽歌》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张果","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}